OL,3,GNEWSASinn Fein calls on Taoiseach to
OL,4,Ameet Drumcree residents as mediator
OL,5,Aappointed
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere have been calls for the Taoiseach
OL,8,F(Irish Prime Minister) Micheal Martin
OL,9,Fto meet with Garvaghy Road residents as
OL,10,Fthe Drumcree dispute continues.
OL,12,FOn Thursday, Portadown Orange District
OL,13,Fsaid on social media that the Parades
OL,14,FCommission had appointed a surprise
OL,15,Fmediation facilitator for the dispute.
OL,17,FSinn Fein MLA John O'Dowd said he was
OL,18,Fconcerned there had been no visible
OL,19,Fengagement from the Irish Government on
OL,20,Fthe issue.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
