OL,3,GNEWSASinn Fein calls on Taoiseach to
OL,4,Ameet Drumcree residents as mediator
OL,5,Aappointed
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe earliest date for a decision by the
OL,8,FParades Commission on the planned
OL,9,FDrumcree march by Portadown Orange
OL,10,FOrder is 23 September ` four days
OL,11,Fbefore the scheduled parade.
